        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Scorpio &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>The last needle is the heart. You have been walking toward it for fourteen strikes.</em></p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> The target has at least 5 needles.</p><p>The target must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> @Damage[16d6[piercing]] damage and paralyzed for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> It dies &mdash; the scarlet star at the Scorpion's heart has found its own.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
